  "independentReview": "Request changes for a separate command schedule. Both trees dropped the first Retry when Cancel, a late callback, and Retry reached the Swift command boundary before the callback job ran. The first Retry made zero marker reads, writes, exchanges or journal changes. A second Retry restored the browser. The exported tick passed 16 of 16 immediate-order checks on each route, so installed UI reachability is unverified. The exact candidate passed all 12 delivered arrival cases, 47 prior controls and independent live-exchange, stale, duplicate, and wrong-scope checks. Scratch was removed.",
